*

# .session-evaluate/ (session-evaluate skill's local run memory) is intentionally
# excluded by the catch-all above — left out of the allow-list on purpose, not an oversight.

!.gitignore
# .claude/ holds Claude Code's own project-scoped runtime state (settings.local.json,
# session/scheduler lock files, etc.) alongside this repo's tracked skill-install
# metadata — allow only the known tracked content, not the whole directory, so new
# runtime droppings stay ignored by default instead of needing a rule each time one appears.
!.claude
.claude/*
!.claude/.skill-lock.json
!.claude/skills
!.claude/skills/**
!CLAUDE.md
!assets
!assets/**
!docs
!docs/**
!config
!config/**
!scripts
!scripts/**
!extended
!extended/**
!skills
!skills/**
!references
!references/**
!CLAUDE.global.md
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!package.json

# Python bytecode from skill scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
